# --- PRISM ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Appended by setup. Every line is here because PRISM ADDS something to your
# repository that git would otherwise offer to commit.
# PRISM ships Python under .prism/ and executes it.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# LIVE GATE VERDICTS, and the one line here that prevents a false pass rather
# than a large diff. The Stop gate short-circuits on a turn-fingerprint match,
# so a committed verdict grants a PASS to every machine that pulls it — for a
# tree that machine never built.
.prism/verify/state/
# The self-extracting installer, if you dropped it in the repository root. Its
# contents are already unpacked into .prism/, tooling/ and build-logic/.
/prism-verify
/prism-verify-*.zip
# NOT IGNORED, DELIBERATELY: every module's detekt.baseline.xml and
# ktlint.baseline.xml.
# They are the observe-posture record — the findings this repository has agreed
# to defer — and they must be COMMITTED. Ignore them and every teammate is met
# with findings the team already decided not to block on. Generated, and still
# yours to keep.
